<title>USA: Rouge Steel Co Q4 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Rouge Steel Co Q4 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>DEARBORN, Mich. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fourth Quarter	     Year</p>
<p>				 1996	1995	1996	 1995</p>
<p> Total Sales	    $318,093 $305,126 $1,307,398 $1,206,566</p>
<p>Costs and Expenses</p>
<p>   Costs of Goods	325,611  289,317  1,251,114  1,082,077</p>
